# Tech stack & dependency versions

Exact installs follow **`package.json`** ranges (**`^`**) and **`package-lock.json`**.

## Runtime & framework

- **Next.js `16.1.7`** — App Router; **`npm run dev`** uses **Turbopack**. Use repo **next-best-practices** skill.
- **React / react-dom `^19.2.4`** — Default to Server Components; **`"use client"`** only for hooks, browser APIs, interactive UI.
- **TypeScript `^5.9.3`** — **`strict: true`**, **`@/*`** alias — **`npm run typecheck`**.

## UI & styling

- **Tailwind `^4.2.1`** + **`@tailwindcss/postcss`** — v4 PostCSS pipeline (`postcss.config.mjs`), not legacy Tailwind 3 plugin shape by default.
- **tailwind-merge `^3.5.0`**, **clsx `^2.1.1`**, **cva `^0.7.1`** — compose with **`cn()`** (`lib/utils.ts`).
- **radix-ui `^1.4.3`** — primitives behind **`components/ui/*`** (shadcn-style).
- **shadcn `^4.7.0`** — CLI/registry only; components are in-repo.
- **lucide-react `^1.14.0`**, **next-themes `^0.4.6`**, **sonner `^2.0.7`**, **tw-animate-css `^1.4.0`**.

## Forms & validation

- **react-hook-form `^7.75.0`** + **@hookform/resolvers `^5.2.2`** + **zod `^4.4.3`** — **Zod 4** APIs (avoid copy-paste from Zod 3-only examples).

## Data & client state

- **@tanstack/react-query `^5.100.9`** (+ devtools) — v5 keys/**`gcTime`**; central **`queryKeys`** (`lib/query-keys.ts`).
- **@tanstack/react-table `^8.21.3`** — headless tables / column defs.
- **axios `^1.16.0`** — **`lib/api/client.ts`** (interceptors, **`normaliseError`**).

## Dates & stores

- **date-fns `^4.1.0`** — parse/format explicitly for API strings (timezone pitfalls).
- **react-day-picker `^10.0.0`** — v10 props API (`components/ui/calendar.tsx`).
- **zustand `^5.0.13`** — small client stores.
- **server-only `^0.0.1`** — guard server-only modules from client bundles.

## Dev tooling

- **eslint `^9.39.4`** + **eslint-config-next `16.1.7`** — **flat** `eslint.config.mjs`; keep **eslint-config-next** on same Next minor as **`next`**.
- **vitest `^3.2.4`** + **@vitejs/plugin-react `^6`**, **jsdom `^27`**, **@testing-library/react `^16`** — **`npm test`**, **`test/setup.ts`**.
- **prettier `^3.8`** + **prettier-plugin-tailwindcss `^0.7`** — **`npm run format`**.

## Practices

1. Upgrade **Next** and **eslint-config-next** together.
2. After bumps: **`lint`**, **`typecheck`**, **`test`**, **`build`**.
3. Prefer framework/library docs matching **installed majors** + repo **`.agents/skills/`**.
